    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d511">

                <pb facs="0569" n="481" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg481"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">721.23/1165: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Geneva</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-16T20:00:00+01:00">February 16, 1933—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received February 16—4:10 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>115. I have conveyed the information in your 68, February 15, 1 p.m.<anchor
                        n="27" xml:id="d511-f1"/> to Drummond. He now informs me that he has just
                    received <pb facs="0570" n="482" xml:id="pg482"/> the same information from the
                    Colombian representative and that the Council Committee has sent a message this
                    afternoon to Lima asking for immediate information as to hostilities which are
                    taking place on Colombian territory.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
